			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Update main entry point to PascalCase convention\n\nUpdate the `main` function in `Source/Library.rs` to invoke `Binary::Main::Entry::Fn()` instead of `Binary::Main::Main()`. This change aligns the root executable entry point with the project-wide PascalCase naming convention and the modularization pattern established in recent commits, where `Main` logic is encapsulated within an `Entry` submodule with an explicit `Fn` suffix.\n\nThis ensures consistency across the `Mountain` crate, where all top-level functions and modules now adhere to strict naming standards.",
